<title>BULGARIA: Bulgaria Oct producer prices rises to 16 pct m/m.</title>
<headline>Bulgaria Oct producer prices rises to 16 pct m/m.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bulgaria's monthly producer price inflation was 16 percent in October after 13.2 percent in September, the National Statistics Institute (NSI) figures show.</p>
</text>
